cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software when using bchR."
type: software
title: "bchR: Access to the Banco Central de Honduras Web API"
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Henry-Osorto/bchR"

authors:
  - family-names: Osorto
    given-names: Henry
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4334-9179"

abstract: >-
  bchR is an R client for the Web API of the Banco Central de Honduras.
  It provides API-key configuration, indicator-catalogue retrieval and
  browsing, individual-series retrieval, schema validation, minimal type
  conversion, and secret-free provenance metadata.

keywords:
  - R
  - Honduras
  - official statistics
  - central bank
  - Web API
  - reproducibility
